// Vormantown Rumors

{20000}{sumbuddy say Vermin got a ded, haf-ogur son in maazoleeum.}
{20001}{Have you heard the rumors about Merton Vorman?  It’s said that the mausoleum behind his house holds his bastard, half-ogre son!}

{20020}{Sumbuddy tell me weird stuff happen in elf village.  Big boss elf Kee-nar her in Vermintown!}
{20021}{Word has come down from the Erriwind Forest…something strange has happened in the elven village of Ter'elon!  Qin’ar, their leader, has come here to speak with Merton Vorman!}

{20040}{Sumbuddy tell me that dwarf king Verik Irunweell here in town.  Nobuddy knows why he here.}
{20041}{Did you see who came into town?  Veryk Ironwill, the king of the Stone Heart Clan!  Word has it he’s staying up at Merton Vorman’s mansion, but no one knows why he’s here!}

{20060}{Sumbudy say a Mr. Cackle Bird take care of Vermins persunnel stuff.}
{20061}{Have you met Mr. Shackleford?  He's Mr. Vorman's lawyer, and takes care of all of his personal affairs.  He's quite an individual!}

{20080}{Uh...sumbuddy say Vermintown a "soshul ex-pediment".}
{20081}{Mr. Vorman founded Vormantown almost 10 years ago...he called it a "social experiment", I think, but I don't know much about things like that...}